@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<section class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Your information</span><h1>Privacy</h1><p>How the member website handles loyalty-account information.</p></div></section>
<div class="legal-copy panel">
    <h2>Information used</h2><p>The website processes your name, email, phone number, birthday, profile image, member identifiers, wallet balances, points, stamps, rewards, vouchers, transaction history, referrals, notifications and feedback when required to provide a feature.</p>
    <h2>Authentication</h2><p>Login details and one-time codes are sent through this server to the Loyalty App V2 API. Authentication cookies are HTTP-only and are not available to browser scripts.</p>
    <h2>External services</h2><p>Member information is obtained from the Loyalty App V2 API. Outlet maps load from OpenStreetMap only when the store page is opened.</p>
    <h2>Account deactivation</h2><p>The available API can deactivate an account but does not provide permanent deletion. Contact the programme administrator if permanent erasure is required.</p>
    <h2>Development notice</h2><p>This application is an educational project. Do not use production customer information or reuse important passwords in its test environment.</p>
</div>
